    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802440/extras/5fb33cb903be8df68ef81043eec95748.avif?t=1715631919\" width=602 height=336 /></span><br><br><br><br><br>Immerse yourself in the enchanting world of 'Secrets of the Shore,' a short visual novel where serenity and suspense intertwine on a picturesque island. When a peaceful getaway is transformed by a sudden, mysterious storm, a tale of intrigue and unexpected connections begins to unfold.<br><br><i>Meet Ashley, the embodiment of vivacity and charm, whose infectious energy brightens every interaction. Her optimistic outlook and adventurous spirit make every moment an exciting journey of discovery. </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802440/extras/055fe5d3467e0d83557f2b5c73ab48b2.avif?t=1715631919\" width=602 height=446 /></span><br><br><i>Then there's Evelyn, the enigmatic and intellectual soul, whose passion for history and mystery captivates and educates. Her depth and reflective nature bring a layer of intrigue to the island's secrets.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802440/extras/ad6a327dfded5ca0d793942aa870e7d4.avif?t=1715631919\" width=602 height=446 /></span><br><br>As the protagonist, your life takes a thrilling turn with each new encounter. Navigate through a series of unforeseen events and build meaningful relationships with these captivating characters. Each decision you make weaves a unique path through the narrative, revealing hidden aspects of the island and its residents.<br><br>From the bonds formed with Ashley and Evelyn to the challenges presented by the storm and its aftermath, 'Secrets of the Shore' is a tale of transformation. It's a story about how unexpected encounters can redefine our lives, uncover hidden strengths, and lead us to find beauty in the unknown.<br><br>Join this adventure of camaraderie, mystery, and self-discovery. Unravel the secrets of the island, explore the depths of human connection, and see how a simple island escape can evolve into a life-changing experience in 'Secrets of the Shore.'<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-quality graphics<br></li><li>230+ images in total<br></li><li>30-60 minutes of gameplay.<br></li><li>An engaging mystery<br></li><li>Sounds and Music</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802440/extras/5fb33cb903be8df68ef81043eec95748.avif?t=1715631919\" width=602 height=336 /></span><br><br><br><br><br>Immerse yourself in the enchanting world of 'Secrets of the Shore,' a short visual novel where serenity and suspense intertwine on a picturesque island. When a peaceful getaway is transformed by a sudden, mysterious storm, a tale of intrigue and unexpected connections begins to unfold.<br><br><i>Meet Ashley, the embodiment of vivacity and charm, whose infectious energy brightens every interaction. Her optimistic outlook and adventurous spirit make every moment an exciting journey of discovery. </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802440/extras/055fe5d3467e0d83557f2b5c73ab48b2.avif?t=1715631919\" width=602 height=446 /></span><br><br><i>Then there's Evelyn, the enigmatic and intellectual soul, whose passion for history and mystery captivates and educates. Her depth and reflective nature bring a layer of intrigue to the island's secrets.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802440/extras/ad6a327dfded5ca0d793942aa870e7d4.avif?t=1715631919\" width=602 height=446 /></span><br><br>As the protagonist, your life takes a thrilling turn with each new encounter. Navigate through a series of unforeseen events and build meaningful relationships with these captivating characters. Each decision you make weaves a unique path through the narrative, revealing hidden aspects of the island and its residents.<br><br>From the bonds formed with Ashley and Evelyn to the challenges presented by the storm and its aftermath, 'Secrets of the Shore' is a tale of transformation. It's a story about how unexpected encounters can redefine our lives, uncover hidden strengths, and lead us to find beauty in the unknown.<br><br>Join this adventure of camaraderie, mystery, and self-discovery. Unravel the secrets of the island, explore the depths of human connection, and see how a simple island escape can evolve into a life-changing experience in 'Secrets of the Shore.'<br><br>Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>High-quality graphics<br></li><li>230+ images in total<br></li><li>30-60 minutes of gameplay.<br></li><li>An engaging mystery<br></li><li>Sounds and Music</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Discover the allure of 'Secrets of the Shore,' where a serene island getaway takes a mysterious turn with the arrival of a storm. Forge meaningful connections with captivating characters and explore the secrets that emerge amidst the changing tides in this charming yet intriguing visual novel.",
